msgid ""
"Could not compute a price for %(product)s in price list %(pricelist)s. The "
"unit price was left unchanged."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo calcular un precio para %(product)s en la lista de precios "
"%(pricelist)s. El precio unitario se dejó sin cambios."

